# 统一换行符：仓库内一律 LF，Windows 工作区检出为 CRLF
# 不设此项时，Windows 开发 + GitHub 协作会造成"整文件变更"的假 diff，
# 把真实改动淹没。
* text=auto

# 显式声明，让 diff 更有意义
*.java   text diff=java
*.xml    text diff=xml
*.md     text
*.yml    text
*.yaml   text
*.properties text

# 脚本：强制换行符（bash 脚本若带 CRLF 会在执行时报奇怪的错）
*.sh     text eol=lf
*.bat    text eol=crlf

# 二进制：不做换行符转换
*.png    binary
*.jpg    binary
*.jpeg   binary
*.gif    binary
*.ico    binary
*.pdf    binary
*.jar    binary
*.zip    binary
